       TZE     ERR                                    CHANGE VERSION 2  LAMI4360
       TIO     ERR                                    CHANGE VERSION 2  LAMI4370
       CAL     ACAN                                   CHANGE VERSION 2  LAMI4380
       ANA     =O7000                                 CHANGE VERSION 2  LAMI4390
       TIF     ERR                                    CHANGE VERSION 2  LAMI4400
       CLA     11                                     CHANGE VERSION 2  LAMI4410
